381	    /**
382	     * The owner's primary identifier, as carried on the {@link OwnerCreatedEvent} audit event: the
383	     * unified {@code memberId}. Routing the audit event through this single accessor keeps the audit
384	     * trail's notion of the owner's identity in one place.
385	     *
386	     * @param owner the freshly created owner, already stamped with its {@code memberId}
387	     * @return the owner's primary identifier
388	     */
389	    private String primaryIdentifier(Owner owner) {
